<section class="story-v2 wide section-v2" id="our-story"><div class="story-image"><img src="{{ 'demo-coffee-1-alt.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="900" height="900" loading="lazy" alt="Glozin demo lifestyle photography of a person holding a coffee bag"><span class="image-caption">Demo lifestyle photography</span></div><div class="story-v2-copy"><span class="kicker">Two roots. One avenue.</span><h2>A place. A feeling.<br>A really good cup.</h2><p>Texas, the 28th state. New Mexico, the 47th. Together, they give our avenue its name — and our coffee its Southwestern soul.</p><p>Inspired by open roads, creative communities, and the warmth of a shared table. We’re here for the coffee, and everything it brings us closer to.</p><div class="story-equation"><span>28<small>TEXAS</small></span><b>+</b><span>47<small>NEW MEXICO</small></span><b>=</b><span>75<small>OUR AVENUE</small></span></div></div></section>
